Package: com.example.ytlegacyfix
Name: YTLegacyFix
Depends: mobilesubstrate (>= 0.9.5000)
Version: 0.1.0-7
Architecture: iphoneos-arm
Description: Work on iOS 7 ONLY.
 I have not tried it on iOS 8 or 9. This tweak fixes the YouTube app for iOS 7 instead of having to download an older version or some random ass janky YouTube client.
 It is very much a WIP since my main focus was to get video playback working on the app first. Any help would be appreciated.
 DM me on discord: magnoliaremaker if you would like to help with this project.
 Thank you guys for using this tweak
